sequenceDiagram
  participant U as Anonymous user/agent
  participant S as Static Explorer
  participant G as Open MCP gateway
  participant P as Policy
  participant D as Open data service
  participant E as Evidence
  U->>S: Search and apply facets
  S->>G: Optional catalogue/data request
  G->>P: Public authority context
  P-->>G: Allow with attribution/limits
  G->>D: Deterministic query
  D-->>G: Result + source versions
  G->>E: Audit and receipt
  G-->>U: Result + evidence receipt
